{"id":"a1f1e7424c0c2277","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-computability.md","title":"可计算性、可枚举性与多一完全性","display":"df-computability — 可计算性、可枚举性与多一完全性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-computability","aliases":["29-df-computability"],"display":"df-computability — 可计算性、可枚举性与多一完全性","depends_on":["[[29-df-tm-computes]]","[[29-df-turing-machine]]"],"source_basis":"仅据所提供的第29本书文本重建缺失接口；不声称恢复缺失外部原文或完成机器证明","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件","revision_verification":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-computability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-computability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-computability — 可计算性、可枚举性与多一完全性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d91cca50bc997dfa\" href=\"?note=d91cca50bc997dfa\" title=\"29-df-tm-computes\">29-df-tm-computes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1dacc2eff0f3c359\" href=\"?note=1dacc2eff0f3c359\" title=\"29-df-turing-machine\">29-df-turing-machine</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"仅据所提供的第29本书文本重建缺失接口；不声称恢复缺失外部原文或完成机器证明"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}_k,\\operatorname{Computes}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}_k,\\operatorname{Computes}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d91cca50bc997dfa\" href=\"?note=d91cca50bc997dfa\" title=\"29-df-tm-computes\">29-df-tm-computes</a> 的具体编码接口。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TM}_{det},\\operatorname{Time},\\operatorname{Acc}\">\\(\\mathsf{TM}_{det},\\operatorname{Time},\\operatorname{Acc}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1dacc2eff0f3c359\" href=\"?note=1dacc2eff0f3c359\" title=\"29-df-turing-machine\">29-df-turing-machine</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\">\\(\\chi_A\\)</span> 是下式的全特征函数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P=(\\mathcal P_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathcal P=(\\mathcal P_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 遍历满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_k\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}\">\\(\\mathcal P_k\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}\\)</span> 的函数族；组成与原始递归算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}_k,\\operatorname{Rec}\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}_k,\\operatorname{Rec}\\)</span> 在下面定义，所有参与函数均为全函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> 是一元部分而不是任意部分可计算函数类。</li>\n<li>复合算子显式保留输出函数的输入元数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x\\in\\mathbb N^k\">\\(\\bar x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=0\">\\(m=0\\)</span> 时内层函数元组为空，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^0=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N^0=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\\)</span>，但复合结果仍以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^k\">\\(\\mathbb N^k\\)</span> 为定义域。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PC}_k\\coloneqq\\{f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\mid\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}_k\\;\\operatorname{Computes}(M,f)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Tot}_k\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PC}_k\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PC}_k\\coloneqq\\{f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\mid\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}_k\\;\\operatorname{Computes}(M,f)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Tot}_k\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PC}_k\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A(n)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{n\\in A},\\qquad\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\mid\\chi_A\\in\\mathrm{Tot}_1\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{RE}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\mid f\\in\\mathrm{PC}_1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_A(n)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{n\\in A},\\qquad\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\mid\\chi_A\\in\\mathrm{Tot}_1\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{RE}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\mid f\\in\\mathrm{PC}_1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb B}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*\\mid\\exists T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{det}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^*\\;(\\operatorname{Time}_T(x)&lt;\\infty\\land(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Acc}_T(x)))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb B}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*\\mid\\exists T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{det}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^*\\;(\\operatorname{Time}_T(x)&lt;\\infty\\land(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Acc}_T(x)))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\leq_m B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Tot}_1\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(n)\\in B),\\qquad\\mathrm{REComplete}_{\\leq_m}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\mid\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\;A\\leq_m B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\leq_m B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Tot}_1\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(n)\\in B),\\qquad\\mathrm{REComplete}_{\\leq_m}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\mid\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\;A\\leq_m B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Z_k(\\bar x)\\coloneqq0,\\quad S(x)\\coloneqq x+1,\\quad\\pi_i^k(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\coloneqq x_i\\quad(1\\leq i\\leq k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Z_k(\\bar x)\\coloneqq0,\\quad S(x)\\coloneqq x+1,\\quad\\pi_i^k(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\coloneqq x_i\\quad(1\\leq i\\leq k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}_k(g;\\langle f_1,\\ldots,f_m\\rangle)(\\bar x)\\coloneqq g(f_1(\\bar x),\\ldots,f_m(\\bar x)),\\quad g:\\mathbb N^m\\to\\mathbb N,\\ f_i:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Comp}_k(g;\\langle f_1,\\ldots,f_m\\rangle)(\\bar x)\\coloneqq g(f_1(\\bar x),\\ldots,f_m(\\bar x)),\\quad g:\\mathbb N^m\\to\\mathbb N,\\ f_i:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rec}(g,h)(\\bar x,0)\\coloneqq g(\\bar x),\\quad\\operatorname{Rec}(g,h)(\\bar x,n+1)\\coloneqq h(\\bar x,n,\\operatorname{Rec}(g,h)(\\bar x,n)),\\quad g:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N,\\ h:\\mathbb N^{k+2}\\to\\mathbb N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Rec}(g,h)(\\bar x,0)\\coloneqq g(\\bar x),\\quad\\operatorname{Rec}(g,h)(\\bar x,n+1)\\coloneqq h(\\bar x,n,\\operatorname{Rec}(g,h)(\\bar x,n)),\\quad g:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N,\\ h:\\mathbb N^{k+2}\\to\\mathbb N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PRClosed}(\\mathcal P)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\left(S\\in\\mathcal P_1\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;Z_k\\in\\mathcal P_k\\land\\forall k\\geq1\\;\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\\pi_i^k\\in\\mathcal P_k\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall k,m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathcal P_m\\;\\forall(f_1,\\ldots,f_m)\\in\\mathcal P_k^m\\;\\operatorname{Comp}_k(g;\\langle f_1,\\ldots,f_m\\rangle)\\in\\mathcal P_k\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathcal P_k\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathcal P_{k+2}\\;\\operatorname{Rec}(g,h)\\in\\mathcal P_{k+1}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PRClosed}(\\mathcal P)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\left(S\\in\\mathcal P_1\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;Z_k\\in\\mathcal P_k\\land\\forall k\\geq1\\;\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\\pi_i^k\\in\\mathcal P_k\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall k,m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathcal P_m\\;\\forall(f_1,\\ldots,f_m)\\in\\mathcal P_k^m\\;\\operatorname{Comp}_k(g;\\langle f_1,\\ldots,f_m\\rangle)\\in\\mathcal P_k\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathcal P_k\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathcal P_{k+2}\\;\\operatorname{Rec}(g,h)\\in\\mathcal P_{k+1}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}_k\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal P_k\\mid\\operatorname{PRClosed}(\\mathcal P)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{PR}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PR}_1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PR}_k\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal P_k\\mid\\operatorname{PRClosed}(\\mathcal P)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{PR}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PR}_1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}_k(g;\\langle\\rangle):\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\\operatorname{Comp}_k(g;\\langle\\rangle)(\\bar x)=g(\\langle\\rangle),\\quad g:\\mathbb N^0\\to\\mathbb N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Comp}_k(g;\\langle\\rangle):\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\\operatorname{Comp}_k(g;\\langle\\rangle)(\\bar x)=g(\\langle\\rangle),\\quad g:\\mathbb N^0\\to\\mathbb N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条只补充原 Gödel 编码、有限可满足性和建议性质文件已经调用的计算论接口。自然数上的可判定集合与二进制字符串上的可判定语言分开记号；多一归约要求全可计算函数。原始递归函数采用最小闭包定义，并显式给出零元函数的类型，避免把抽象语法树当成自然数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-tm-computes","status":"resolved","id":"d91cca50bc997dfa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-tm-computes]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"1dacc2eff0f3c359","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-turing-machi