},\\qquad\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\mid\\chi_A\\in\\mathrm{Tot}_1\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{RE}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\mid f\\in\\mathrm{PC}_1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb B}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*\\mid\\exists T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{det}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^*\\;(\\operatorname{Time}_T(x)<\\infty\\land(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Acc}_T(x)))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\leq_m B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Tot}_1\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(n)\\in B),\\qquad\\mathrm{REComplete}_{\\leq_m}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\mid\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\;A\\leq_m B\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"Z_k(\\bar x)\\coloneqq0,\\quad S(x)\\coloneqq x+1,\\quad\\pi_i^k(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\coloneqq x_i\\quad(1\\leq i\\leq k).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}_k(g;\\langle f_1,\\ldots,f_m\\rangle)(\\bar x)\\coloneqq g(f_1(\\bar x),\\ldots,f_m(\\bar x)),\\quad g:\\mathbb N^m\\to\\mathbb N,\\ f_i:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rec}(g,h)(\\bar x,0)\\coloneqq g(\\bar x),\\quad\\operatorname{Rec}(g,h)(\\bar x,n+1)\\coloneqq h(\\bar x,n,\\operatorname{Rec}(g,h)(\\bar x,n)),\\quad g:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N,\\ h:\\mathbb N^{k+2}\\to\\mathbb N.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PRClosed}(\\mathcal P)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\left(S\\in\\mathcal P_1\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;Z_k\\in\\mathcal P_k\\land\\forall k\\geq1\\;\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\\pi_i^k\\in\\mathcal P_k\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall k,m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathcal P_m\\;\\forall(f_1,\\ldots,f_m)\\in\\mathcal P_k^m\\;\\operatorname{Comp}_k(g;\\langle f_1,\\ldots,f_m\\rangle)\\in\\mathcal P_k\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathcal P_k\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathcal P_{k+2}\\;\\operatorname{Rec}(g,h)\\in\\mathcal P_{k+1}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}_k\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal P_k\\mid\\operatorname{PRClosed}(\\mathcal P)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{PR}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PR}_1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}_k(g;\\langle\\rangle):\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\\operatorname{Comp}_k(g;\\langle\\rangle)(\\bar x)=g(\\langle\\rangle),\\quad g:\\mathbb N^0\\to\\mathbb N.","display":true}],"bytes":4303,"backlinks":[{"id":"a7fafe8aaa1edd6c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PR},\\mathrm{Tot}_1,\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb N}$ 由 [[29-df-computability]] 定义；$\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau$ 由 [[29-df-sentence]] 定义。$\\bar a$ 为有限自然数序列，$\\Vert$ 为串接，$\\langle\\rangle$ 为空序列。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-180","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[29-df-turing-machine]]、[[29-df-computability]]、[[29-df-resource-constructibility]] — 原计算原语的有限描述及明确资源接口。"},{"id":"575d4fea7f098cfb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$C_1,C_2,D_1,D_2\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb B^*)$；$H\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 满足 $H\\notin\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb N}$。$\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb N}$、$\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb B}$ 取 [[29-df-computability]]，分别作用于自然数集和二进制语言。"},{"id":"7f92cb4acad3757e","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tot}_3$ 是 [[29-df-computability]] 的全可计算三元数值函数类。$m\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\bar\\psi=(\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_m)$。"},{"id":"5055a09842f5520b","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Rel}(S)$、$\\operatorname{ar}$ 由 [[29-df-vocab]] 定义；$\\mathrm{RE},\\mathrm{REComplete}_{\\leq_m}$ 由 [[29-df-computability]] 定义。"},{"id":"2995f1052910e064","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$g\\in\\operatorname{GNum}(\\tau)$；$\\mathrm{RE},\\mathrm{Tot}_1,\\leq_m,\\mathrm{REComplete}_{\\leq_m}$ 均取 [[29-df-computability]] 的自然数编码接口。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-computability]]"}],"outgo